(2) Interpretation: -
(2.1) In these Articles, unless the context requires otherwise:
i). reference to the singular includes a reference to the plural and vice versa;
ii). reference to any gender includes a reference to all other genders;
iii). reference to an individual shall include his legal representative, successor, legal heir, executor and
administrator;
iv). reference to statutory provisions shall be construed as meaning and including references also to any
amendment or re -enactment (whether before or after the date of these Articles) for the time being in
force and to all statutory instruments or orders made pursuant to statutory provisions;
